      "question_latex": "7. 学校计划在一块周长\\(10\\,\\mathrm m\\)的等腰梯形空地上修建花坛（如右图）。现要将这块梯形空地划分成一个平行四边形和一个三角形的花坛，请你在图中划分一下。若要给三角形花坛四周安装护栏，一共需要护栏（    ）米。（题干续下一页）",
      "options": [],
      "tables": [],
      "diagrams": [
        {
          "name": "p097_s07_g1",
          "role": "question",
          "tikz": "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=1.1]\\draw(0,0)--(4,0)--(3,1.732)--(1,1.732)--cycle;\\node[above]at(2,1.732){2米};\\node[below]at(2,0){4米};\\end{tikzpicture}"
        },
        {
          "name": "p097_s07_a1",
          "role": "answer",
          "tikz": "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=1.1]\\draw(0,0)--(4,0)--(3,1.732)--(1,1.732)--cycle;\\node[above]at(2,1.732){2米};\\node[below]at(2,0){4米};\\draw[red](3,1.732)--(2,0);\\node[red,above left]at(1,1.732){$A$};\\node[red,above right]at(3,1.732){$B$};\\node[red,below right]at(4,0){$C$};\\node[red,below left]at(0,0){$D$};\\fill[red](2,0)circle(1.2pt)node[above left]{$E$};\\end{tikzpicture}",
          "notes": " 依解析辅助命名用红字补A、B、C、D、E及E点，原黑2米/4米条件、外框、分割线与几何位置不变。"
